WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
CodeRabbit is the agentic governance and
control layer for software development.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.060
We help teams of every size
ship high-quality code faster.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.970
The platform supports the
development phases you see here,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.420
from planning and writing
code through review and merge.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.720
Today, we'll follow that work through
code review, Triage, and Change Stack.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.800
Then look at security
from both the engineering

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.640
and application security perspectives.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.200
We'll finish with Automations,
the Coding Agent, and Slack.
